### 1. User Management - Create Admin Account
POST http://localhost:3000/user-management/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "firstName": "Demo",
  "lastName": "Admin",
  "role": "admin"
}

### 2. User Management - Login (Copy token from response)
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/user-management/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.admin@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. User Management - Get All Users
GET http://localhost:3000/user-management/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 4. User Management - Request Password Reset OTP
POST http://localhost:3000/user-management/auth/forgot-password/otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "demo.admin@example.com"
}

### 5. SMS Module - Send Test SMS
POST http://localhost:3000/sms/send
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "to": "+14155552671",
  "message": "Demo SMS Message!"
}

### 6. SMS Module - Get SMS Logs
GET http://localhost:3000/sms/logs
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 7. Telegram Module - Broadcast Message to Channel
POST http://localhost:3000/telegram/broadcast
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Demo Telegram Broadcast Message!"
}
